{"how-acoustic-and-digital-pianos-make-sound": [960, "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Schibsted+Grotesk:wght@500;700;800&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,500;1,500&family=Noto+Music&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{width:1200px;height:960px;font-family:\"Schibsted Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;background:#f3f6f7;color:#15191c;padding:52px 60px 0;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n.eyebrow{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2e6475}\nh1{font-size:48px;line-height:1.05;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:8px 0 26px}\n.foot{position:absolute;left:60px;right:60px;bottom:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:17px;color:#56666e;font-weight:500}\n.foot b{letter-spacing:.12em;color:#2e6475}\n.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9e2e5;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgb(21 25 28/6%),0 8px 24px rgb(21 25 28/6%)}\nsvg text{font-family:\"Schibsted Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.mus{font-family:\"Noto Music\",serif}\n</style></head><body><div class=\"eyebrow\">How they work</div><h1>How each piano makes its sound</h1><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px\">\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:22px 24px\"><div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#b86a0a\">ACOUSTIC PIANO</div><div style=\"font-size:26px;font-weight:800;margin:4px 0 16px\">Wood, felt and steel</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#f6b31e;color:#1b1400;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px\">1</div><div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">Key</div><div style=\"font-size:16.5px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;line-height:1.35\">You press the key, which works as a lever.</div></div></div><div style=\"width:3px;height:16px;background:#f6b31e;margin-left:22px;opacity:.5\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#f6b31e;color:#1b1400;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px\">2</div><div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">Hammer</div><div style=\"font-size:16.5px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;line-height:1.35\">A felt hammer flies up and strikes the strings.</div></div></div><div style=\"width:3px;height:16px;background:#f6b31e;margin-left:22px;opacity:.5\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#f6b31e;color:#1b1400;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px\">3</div><div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">Strings</div><div style=\"font-size:16.5px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;line-height:1.35\">Steel strings vibrate; the damper lifts to let them ring.</div></div></div><div style=\"width:3px;height:16px;background:#f6b31e;margin-left:22px;opacity:.5\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#f6b31e;color:#1b1400;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px\">4</div><div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">Soundboard</div><div style=\"font-size:16.5px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;line-height:1.35\">A large wooden board amplifies the vibration.</div></div></div><div style=\"width:3px;height:16px;background:#f6b31e;margin-left:22px;opacity:.5\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#f6b31e;color:#1b1400;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px\">5</div><div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">Your ears</div><div style=\"font-size:16.5px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;line-height:1.35\">Sound fills the room, with real resonance from every string.</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:22px 24px\"><div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#2e6475\">DIGITAL PIANO</div><div style=\"font-size:26px;font-weight:800;margin:4px 0 16px\">Sensors and samples</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#2e6475;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px\">1</div><div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">Key</div><div style=\"font-size:16.5px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;line-height:1.35\">A weighted key copies the feel of a hammer action.</div></div></div><div style=\"width:3px;height:16px;background:#2e6475;margin-left:22px;opacity:.5\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#2e6475;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px\">2</div><div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">Sensors</div><div style=\"font-size:16.5px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;line-height:1.35\">Two or three sensors per key measure how fast it moved.</div></div></div><div style=\"width:3px;height:16px;background:#2e6475;margin-left:22px;opacity:.5\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#2e6475;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px\">3</div><div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">Sound engine</div><div style=\"font-size:16.5px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;line-height:1.35\">Chooses the matching recording, or models the string.</div></div></div><div style=\"width:3px;height:16px;background:#2e6475;margin-left:22px;opacity:.5\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#2e6475;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px\">4</div><div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">Amplifier</div><div style=\"font-size:16.5px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;line-height:1.35\">Turns the signal into sound at the volume you set.</div></div></div><div style=\"width:3px;height:16px;background:#2e6475;margin-left:22px;opacity:.5\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#2e6475;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px\">5</div><div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">Speakers or headphones</div><div style=\"font-size:16.5px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;line-height:1.35\">The room, or only you, hears it.</div></div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:16px;padding:14px 20px;font-size:18px;background:#fff8e6\">The difference you hear: an acoustic's untouched strings vibrate in sympathy. Better digitals simulate this \"string resonance\"; cheaper ones don't.</div><div class=\"foot\"><span>Pianoers.com \u00b7 Acoustic vs digital piano</span><b>PIANOERS.COM</b></div></body></html>"]}